From 3fa1b3af7bbedc44c2a6311545c94a7a6a0ef19d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:09:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/meson: use native SC2 video-fetch register banks

SC2 retains the G12A blending path but relocates linear MIF and AFBC
fetch banks. Translate all touched MIF fields and route AFBC using the
SC2 memory-path selector while preserving older SoC behavior.

The Meson DRM directory compiles. A reversible native scanout experiment
with the same register routing displayed the Main10 compressed fixture;
this commit has not yet been booted as a production kernel.

Change-Id: I3230522b8ccc32ca2d7cd990aa1e84eed3b0d5a9
